    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282110/extras/2056022dc5f828434a66b96e0bc5103e.avif?t=1754797003\" width=800 height=282 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca5<strong><i>Join Saki-chan, the fierce shark girl and high general of the alien empire, on her wild ride to conquer Earth!</i></strong>\ud83d\udca5</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282110/extras/5222533a3a00d332c4483e169493d5cc.poster.avif?t=1754797003\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282110/extras/5222533a3a00d332c4483e169493d5cc.webm?t=1754797003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282110/extras/5222533a3a00d332c4483e169493d5cc.mp4?t=1754797003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1fSaki-chan has a unique training regimen: she zooms through high-speed tunnel tracks, using her own underling Tentamons as practice targets and meat shields. Take control of Saki-chan and experience the thrill of high-speed racing while mowing down those poor Tentamons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1fBut wait, there's a twist! One brave Tentamon captain has had enough of Saki-chan's bloodlust and decides to stage a coup, causing chaos on her mothership. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1fNow, it's up to you to help Saki-chan chase down the rebellious Tentamon through meticulously designed tunnel levels. Gather upgrades, dodge obstacles, and teach that traitor a brutal lesson it won't forget!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282110/extras/ea41b045c3c414fd69a6b4b25f88c204.poster.avif?t=1754797003\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282110/extras/ea41b045c3c414fd69a6b4b25f88c204.webm?t=1754797003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282110/extras/ea41b045c3c414fd69a6b4b25f88c204.mp4?t=1754797003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1fAnd that's not all! Customize Saki-chan with a variety of costumes to suit your style. Need a break from the action? Head to the interactive massage room to relax and recharge before diving back into the fray.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Are you ready to race, upgrade, and unleash Saki-chan's fury? The chase is on!</i></strong></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282110/extras/2056022dc5f828434a66b96e0bc5103e.avif?t=1754797003\" width=800 height=282 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca5<strong><i>Join Saki-chan, the fierce shark girl and high general of the alien empire, on her wild ride to conquer Earth!</i></strong>\ud83d\udca5</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282110/extras/5222533a3a00d332c4483e169493d5cc.poster.avif?t=1754797003\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282110/extras/5222533a3a00d332c4483e169493d5cc.webm?t=1754797003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282110/extras/5222533a3a00d332c4483e169493d5cc.mp4?t=1754797003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1fSaki-chan has a unique training regimen: she zooms through high-speed tunnel tracks, using her own underling Tentamons as practice targets and meat shields. Take control of Saki-chan and experience the thrill of high-speed racing while mowing down those poor Tentamons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1fBut wait, there's a twist! One brave Tentamon captain has had enough of Saki-chan's bloodlust and decides to stage a coup, causing chaos on her mothership. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1fNow, it's up to you to help Saki-chan chase down the rebellious Tentamon through meticulously designed tunnel levels. Gather upgrades, dodge obstacles, and teach that traitor a brutal lesson it won't forget!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282110/extras/ea41b045c3c414fd69a6b4b25f88c204.poster.avif?t=1754797003\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282110/extras/ea41b045c3c414fd69a6b4b25f88c204.webm?t=1754797003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3282110/extras/ea41b045c3c414fd69a6b4b25f88c204.mp4?t=1754797003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1fAnd that's not all! Customize Saki-chan with a variety of costumes to suit your style. Need a break from the action? Head to the interactive massage room to relax and recharge before diving back into the fray.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Are you ready to race, upgrade, and unleash Saki-chan's fury? The chase is on!</i></strong></h2>",
    "short_description": "Join Saki-chan, the fierce shark girl, on her wild ride to conquer Earth! Race through deadly tunnels, mow down Tentamons, and chase after rebellious traitors. Customize Saki-chan with cool costumes and relax in the interactive massage room. Ready to unleash her fury? The chase is on!",
